          <div style="max-width:48rem;margin:0 auto;">
            <h2 style="font-family:var(--font-serif);font-weight:700;font-size:2rem;margin-bottom:1.25rem;">What is answer engine optimization?</h2>
            <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.25rem;">
              Answer engine optimization (AEO) is the work of getting your business named when a customer asks an AI assistant a question instead of running a search. A search results page shows ten businesses. An AI answer names two or three. Being on page one no longer means being in the answer.
            </p>
            <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.25rem;">
              For a local service business, most of what decides that answer sits <strong>off</strong> your website: your Google Business Profile, how many recent reviews you have and whether you reply to them, and whether your business name, address, and phone number match everywhere they appear online. Your website matters too, but mainly for whether it answers questions plainly enough to be quoted.
            </p>
            <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;line-height:1.8;">
              That is the whole job, and none of it is mysterious. It is careful, repetitive work that most owners do not have time to do.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
